  link { url = "/docs/tensor-functions", "Numerical operations — products, reductions and row math" },
  link { url = "/docs/task-functions", "Tasks and devices — parallel mapping and transfers" }
}

h2 { "Standard modules" }

Standard modules are explicit imports included with the compiler. They do not require package installation.

