h2 { "Program output and external libraries" }

Applications display output explicitly with std/io and return unit or std/process ExitStatus from main. Console I/O and formatting are standard-module imports; file I/O is provided by std/fs. Network I/O is not provided by these modules. Packages can export their own functions; those names belong to the package rather than this built-in index.

list {
  link { url = "/docs/packages", "Using source packages" }
}
